WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:05.100
Tuna have found a new use for their lymphatic systems

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.980
In humans, the lymphatic system produces

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.820
and transports white blood cells

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:20.080
Tuna have co-opted it for an additional job

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.640
The liquid lymph is used to create hydraulic pressure,

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.280
which the tuna use to raise their fins.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.300
The higher angle helps stabilize quick turns

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.300
without reducing speed.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.560
So the tuna give their fins a boost when feeding

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:43.560
to zip up and turn around quickly...

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.560
then snatch their prize

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.940
Instant sushi dinner. Yum.

